    thinking: "**Designing the Switch Component**\n\nI\'m now diving into the implementation phase, specifically focusing on building the glassmorphic Illuminate Toggle Switch component and its integration within `App.tsx`. The core requirement is the interactive \"Illuminate\" feature, and I\'m planning to follow a glassmorphic aesthetic.\n\n\n**Aligning the Visuals**\n\nI\'m currently focused on the positioning and visual style of the toggle switch. It should be in the top-right corner, and I\'ve worked out the positioning to be responsive across different screen sizes. I\'m excited about making the light beam originate directly from the switch! To achieve this, I\'m calculating the switch\'s center position on render and passing it to `VolumetricLightBeam`. I\'m also now considering the \"Dark Mode\" styling, with a rich navy backdrop and a cyan/purple glow. The frosted glass switch look with a neon cyan aura is the key to that look!\n\n\n**Refining the Illumination**\n\nI\'m now detailing the \"Illuminated\" state with precision. The light beam\'s intensity will increase smoothly, alongside a blooming ambient glow. The thumb\'s rightward glide and halo glow are also being perfected. I\'ve designed the \"Illuminated\" label and icon, and I\'m ensuring smooth transitions. I\'m focusing on user interactions, now!\n\n\n**Exploring Color Palettes**\n\nI\'m now diving into color palettes. I\'ve been experimenting with several themes, including \"Cyber Mint,\" \"Solar Aurora,\" and \"Moonlight Frost,\" with each having two primary colors. I\'m also planning to incorporate a spread angle slider, parallax sensitivity, and a breathing motion toggle for added effects. I\'m thinking of creating a \"Copy Component\" modal for developers, which will give them the configuration ready to drop into any project! I\'m making sure all typography is minimal, elegant, and non-cluttered. And I\'ve checked what icons can be used from `lucide-react`, such as `Sun`, `Moon`, and `Sparkles`.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1337768"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useState, useRef, useEffect, useId } from \'react\';\\nimport {\\n  Sun,\\n  Moon,\\n  Sliders,\\n  Copy,\\n  Check,\\n  RotateCcw,\\n  Eye,\\n  EyeOff,\\n  Zap,\\n  Info,\\n  Maximize2\\n} from \'lucide-react\';\\nimport { VolumetricLightBeam } from \'./components/VolumetricLightBeam.tsx\';\\n\\ninterface ColorPreset {\\n  id: string;\\n  name: string;\\n  core: string;\\n  secondary: string;\\n  description: string;\\n}\\n\\nconst COLOR_PRESETS: ColorPreset[] = [\\n  {\\n    id: \'cosmic\',\\n    name: \'Electric Cosmic\',\\n    core: \'#00f2fe\',\\n    secondary: \'#8a2be2\',\\n    description: \'Electric cyan core tapering into neon violet\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'ultraviolet\',\\n    name: \'Ultraviolet Glow\',\\n    core: \'#ff007f\',\\n    secondary: \'#7928ca\',\\n    description: \'Vibrant neon magenta into deep ultraviolet\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'cyber\',\\n    name: \'Cyber Aurora\',\\n    core: \'#00f5a0\',\\n    secondary: \'#00d9f5\',\\n    description: \'Emerald neon dissolving into oceanic cyan\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'solar\',\\n    name: \'Solar Flare\',\\n    core: \'#ffaa00\',\\n    secondary: \'#ff3366\',\\n    description: \'Molten gold shifting into radiant crimson\',\\n  },\\n  {\\n    id: \'moonlight\',\\n    name: \'Pure Moonlight\',\\n    core: \'#ffffff\',\\n    secondary: \'#38bdf8\',\\n    description: \'Crystalline white core with frosty azure rim\',\\n  },\\n];\\n\\nexport default function App() {\\n  // Illuminate switch state (default: Dark Mode with cosmic beam)\\n  const [isIlluminated, setIsIlluminated] = useState(false);\\n\\n  // Customization settings\\n  const [selectedPreset, setSelectedPreset] = useState<ColorPreset>(COLOR_PRESETS[0]);\\n  const [intensity, setIntensity] = useState(1.0);\\n  const [spreadAngle, setSpreadAngle] = useState(42);\\n  const [maxSway, setMaxSway] = useState(8);\\n  const [idleMotion, setIdleMotion] = useState(true);\\n\\n  // UI display toggles\\n  const [showControls, setShowControls] = useState(false);\\n  const [pureCanvasView, setPureCanvasView] = useState(false);\\n  const [copiedCode, setCopiedCode] = useState(false);\\n  const [showDetails, setShowDetails] = useState(false);\\n\\n  // Measure toggle switch element to anchor beam origin exactly to its fixture\\n  const toggleRef = useRef<HTMLButtonElement | null>(null);\\n  const [originCoord, setOriginCoord] = useState<{ x: number; y: number } | null>(null);\\n\\n  const updateToggleOrigin = () => {\\n    if (toggleRef.current) {\\n      const rect = toggleRef.current.getBoundingClientRect();\\n      setOriginCoord({\\n        x: rect.left + rect.width / 2,\\n        y: rect.top + rect.height / 2,\\n      });\\n    }\\n  };\\n\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    updateToggleOrigin();\\n    window.addEventListener(\'resize\', updateToggleOrigin, { passive: true });\\n    window.addEventListener(\'scroll\', updateToggleOrigin, { passive: true });\\n    return () => {\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'resize\', updateToggleOrigin);\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'scroll\', updateToggleOrigin);\\n    };\\n  }, [pureCanvasView, showControls]);\\n\\n  // Keyboard shortcut: Press Escape or F to toggle pure canvas view\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const handleKeyDown = (e: KeyboardEvent) => {\\n      if (e.key === \'Escape\' && pureCanvasView) {\\n        setPureCanvasView(false);\\n      } else if (e.key === \' \' && e.target === document.body) {\\n        setIsIlluminated((prev) => !prev);\\n      }\\n    };\\n    window.addEventListener(\'keydown\', handleKeyDown);\\n    return () => window.removeEventListener(\'keydown\', handleKeyDown);\\n  }, [pureCanvasView]);\\n\\n  const handleReset = () => {\\n    setSelectedPreset(COLOR_PRESETS[0]);\\n    setIntensity(1.0);\\n    setSpreadAngle(42);\\n    setMaxSway(8);\\n    setIdleMotion(true);\\n    setIsIlluminated(false);\\n  };\\n\\n  const handleCopySnippet = () => {\\n    const codeString = `<VolumetricLightBeam\\n  isIlluminated={${isIlluminated}}\\n  coreColor=\\\"${selectedPreset.core}\\\"\\n  secondaryColor=\\\"${selectedPreset.secondary}\\\"\\n  backgroundColor=\\\"#0b0d19\\\"\\n  intensityMultiplier={${intensity}}\\n  spreadAngleDeg={${spreadAngle}}\\n  maxSwayDeg={${maxSway}}\\n  idleMotion={${idleMotion}}\\n/>`;\\n    navigator.clipboard.writeText(codeString);\\n    setCopiedCode(true);\\n    setTimeout(() => setCopiedCode(false), 2400);\\n  };\\n\\n  return (\\n    <main className=\\\"relative min-h-screen w-full bg-[#0b0d19] text-slate-100 overflow-x-hidden selection:bg-cyan-500/30 selection:text-cyan-200\\\">\\n      {/* \\n        ========================================================================\\n        1. THE VOLUMETRIC LIGHT BEAM CANVAS (Background Layer)\\n        - Zero particles, zero grid lines, zero star-dots\\n        - Deep velvety midnight navy base (#0b0d19)\\n        - Electric cyan (#00f2fe) into neon violet (#8a2be2)\\n        - Parallax cursor sway & idle undulation\\n        ========================================================================\\n      */}\\n      <VolumetricLightBeam\\n        isIlluminated={isIlluminated}\\n        coreColor={selectedPreset.core}\\n        secondaryColor={selectedPreset.secondary}\\n        backgroundColor=\\\"#0b0d19\\\"\\n        intensityMultiplier={intensity}\\n        spreadAngleDeg={spreadAngle}\\n        maxSwayDeg={maxSway}\\n        idleMotion={idleMotion}\\n        originOverride={originCoord}\\n      />\\n\\n      {/* \\n        ========================================================================\\n        2. INTERACTIVE \\\"ILLUMINATE\\\" TOGGLE SWITCH\\n        - Fixed in the top-right corner over the light\'s origin\\n        - Minimalist, glassmorphic pill switch (backdrop-blur-md)\\n        - Default state: \\\"Dark Mode\\\"\\n        - Toggling boosts beam intensity & updates custom properties smoothly\\n        ========================================================================\\n      */}\\n      <header className=\\\"fixed top-6 right-6 md:top-8 md:right-8 z-50 flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n        {/* Quick pure canvas preview trigger */}\\n        <button\\n          onClick={() => setPureCanvasView(!pureCanvasView)}\\n          title={pureCanvasView ? \'Restore UI controls\' : \'Zen View (Pure Canvas)\'}\\n          className=\\\"group relative flex items-center justify-center w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-white/[0.04] hover:bg-white/[0.09] border border-white/[0.12] hover:border-white/[0.25] backdrop-blur-md text-slate-400 hover:text-slate-100 transition-all duration-200 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400\\\"\\n          aria-label={pureCanvasView ? \'Restore UI controls\' : \'Pure canvas background view\'}\\n        >\\n          {pureCanvasView ? <Eye className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" /> : <EyeOff className=\\\"w-4 h-4\\\" />}\\n          <span className=\\\"sr-only\\\">Toggle Pure Canvas View</span>\\n          \\n          {/* Tooltip */}\\n          <span className=\\\"absolute -bottom-8 right-0 pointer-events-none opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-[11px] font-medium text-slate-300 bg-slate-900/90 border border-white/10 px-2 py-0.5 rounded whitespace-nowrap backdrop-blur-sm\\\">\\n            {pureCanvasView ? \'Show UI\' : \'Zen View\'}\\n          </span>\\n        </button>\\n\\n        {/* The Primary Glassmorphic Illuminate Pill Switch */}\\n        <button\\n          ref={toggleRef}\\n          role=\\\"switch\\\"\\n          aria-checked={isIlluminated}\\n          aria-label=\\\"Toggle volumetric light beam illumination\\\"\\n          onClick={() => {\\n            setIsIlluminated(!isIlluminated);\\n            // Slight delay then re-measure to guarantee origin accuracy\\n            setTimeout(updateToggleOrigin, 50);\\n          }}\\n          className={`group relative flex items-center gap-2.5 px-3.5 py-2 rounded-full backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-300 cursor-pointer select-none focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400 ${\\n            isIlluminated\\n              ? \'bg-white/[0.12] border border-cyan-400/50 shadow-[0_0_25px_rgba(0,242,254,0.35)]\'\\n              : \'bg-white/[0.04] border border-white/[0.14] hover:border-white/[0.28] shadow-[0_8px_32px_rgba(0,0,0,0.4)]\'\\n          }`}\\n        >\\n          {/* Glowing Aperture Ring on the toggle */}\\n          <span\\n            aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n            className={`relative flex items-center justify-center w-5 h-5 rounded-full transition-transform duration-300 ${\\n              isIlluminated ? \'scale-110\' : \'scale-100\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            {/* Halo bloom behind icon */}\\n            <span\\n              className={`absolute inset-0 rounded-full transition-all duration-500 ${\\n                isIlluminated\\n                  ? \'bg-cyan-400/40 blur-[6px] scale-150 animate-pulse\'\\n                  : \'bg-transparent\'\\n              }`}\\n            />\\n            {isIlluminated ? (\\n              <Sun className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-200 transition-colors drop-shadow-[0_0_6px_#00f2fe]\\\" />\\n            ) : (\\n              <Moon className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-slate-400 group-hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors\\\" />\\n            )}\\n          </span>\\n\\n          {/* Switch Label */}\\n          <span className=\\\"text-xs font-medium tracking-wide whitespace-nowrap transition-colors duration-200\\\">\\n            {isIlluminated ? (\\n              <span className=\\\"text-cyan-100 font-semibold drop-shadow-[0_0_8px_rgba(0,242,254,0.4)]\\\">\\n                Illuminated\\n              </span>\\n            ) : (\\n              <span className=\\\"text-slate-300 group-hover:text-slate-100\\\">\\n                Illuminate\\n              </span>\\n            )}\\n          </span>\\n\\n          {/* Minimalist Switch Track & Pill Thumb */}\\n          <div\\n            aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\"\\n            className={`relative w-8 h-4 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors duration-300 ${\\n              isIlluminated\\n                ? \'bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-500 to-indigo-500\'\\n                : \'bg-white/10 group-hover:bg-white/15\'\\n            }`}\\n          >\\n            <div\\n              className={`w-3 h-3 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform duration-300 shadow-sm ${\\n                isIlluminated\\n                  ? \'translate-x-4 shadow-[0_0_8px_#00f2fe]\'\\n                  : \'translate-x-0 bg-slate-300\'\\n              }`}\\n            />\\n          </div>\\n        </button>\\n      </header>\\n\\n      {/* \\n        ========================================================================\\n        3. FOREGROUND DEMO CONTENT & INTERACTIVE SHOWCASE\\n        (Visible when pureCanvasView is false)\\n        ========================================================================\\n      */}\\n      {!pureCanvasView && (\\n        <div className=\\\"relative z-10 flex flex-col justify-between min-h-screen px-6 py-12 md:px-16 lg:px-24 pointer-events-none\\\">\\n          {/* Top Brand Tag / Category */}\\n          <div className=\\\"pt-2 pointer-events-auto\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2 text-xs font-medium text-slate-400 tracking-wider uppercase\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"text-cyan-400 font-semibold\\\">Webflow Illuminate Dynamics</span>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <span>Smooth Volumetric Light</span>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <span>Solid Midnight Navy</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Hero Section */}\\n          <section className=\\\"max-w-2xl py-16 md:py-24 pointer-events-auto\\\">\\n            <h1 className=\\\"text-4xl sm:text-5xl lg:text-6xl font-semibold tracking-tight text-white leading-[1.12] text-balance\\\">\\n              Atmospheric stage light cutting through velvet dark.\\n            </h1>\\n\\n            <p className=\\\"mt-6 text-base sm:text-lg text-slate-300 font-normal leading-relaxed text-pretty max-w-xl\\\">\\n              An interactive volumetric spotlight projecting diagonally across your canvas.\\n              Zero particles, zero grid lines, zero speckles\342\200\224just smooth organic falloff\\n              blending electric cyan into neon violet.\\n            </p>\\n\\n            {/* Action Buttons */}\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3\\\">\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setIsIlluminated(!isIlluminated)}\\n                className={`px-5 py-2.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg transition-all duration-200 flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer shadow-lg active:scale-95 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400 ${\\n                  isIlluminated\\n                    ? \'bg-cyan-400 text-slate-950 hover:bg-cyan-300 shadow-cyan-500/20\'\\n                    : \'bg-white text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-100 shadow-black/40\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <Zap className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>{isIlluminated ? \'Switch to Dark Mode\' : \'Illuminate the Room\'}</span>\\n              </button>\\n\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setShowControls(!showControls)}\\n                className=\\\"px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-white bg-white/[0.06] hover:bg-white/[0.12] border border-white/10 rounded-lg backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-200 flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400\\\"\\n              >\\n                <Sliders className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                <span>{showControls ? \'Close Inspector\' : \'Tune Physics & Colors\'}</span>\\n              </button>\\n\\n              <button\\n                onClick={handleCopySnippet}\\n                className=\\\"px-4 py-2.5 text-xs font-medium text-slate-200 hover:text-white bg-white/[0.06] hover:bg-white/[0.12] border border-white/10 rounded-lg backdrop-blur-md transition-all duration-200 flex items-center gap-2 cursor-pointer focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-cyan-400\\\"\\n              >\\n                {copiedCode ? (\\n                  <>\\n                    <Check className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-emerald-400\\\" />\\n                    <span className=\\\"text-emerald-400 font-semibold\\\">Snippet Copied!</span>\\n                  </>\\n                ) : (\\n                  <>\\n                    <Copy className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-slate-400\\\" />\\n                    <span>Copy Component</span>\\n                  </>\\n                )}\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Subtle specs callout */}\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-8 flex flex-wrap items-center gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400\\\">\\n              <span className=\\\"flex items-center gap-1.5\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"inline-block w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400\\\" />\\n                <span>Origin: Top-Right</span>\\n              </span>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <span>Projection: 225\302\260 Diagonal</span>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <span>Damped Parallax: \302\261{maxSway}\302\260</span>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <span>Falloff: Feathered Screen Blur</span>\\n            </div>\\n          </section>\\n\\n          {/* Footer Bar */}\\n          <footer className=\\\"pt-6 pb-2 border-t border-white/[0.08] flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 text-xs text-slate-400 pointer-events-auto\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n              <span>Pure 60fps HTML5 Canvas 2D</span>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <span>Velvety #0b0d19 Navy</span>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <span>Zero Grain / Zero Pixels</span>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-3\\\">\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setShowDetails(!showDetails)}\\n                className=\\\"hover:text-slate-200 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n              >\\n                <Info className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Specs & Formula</span>\\n              </button>\\n              <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setPureCanvasView(true)}\\n                className=\\\"hover:text-cyan-300 transition-colors flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\\\"\\n              >\\n                <Maximize2 className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n                <span>Fullscreen Canvas (Zen)</span>\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </footer>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* \\n        ========================================================================\\n        4. INSPECTOR / CUSTOMIZATION DRAWER\\n        (Allows fine-tuning beam angle, colors, idle motion, intensity)\\n        ========================================================================\\n      */}\\n      {showControls && !pureCanvasView && (\\n        <aside\\n          role=\\\"dialog\\\"\\n          aria-label=\\\"Beam Customizer\\\"\\n          className=\\\"fixed bottom-6 left-6 right-6 md:left-auto md:right-8 md:bottom-8 md:w-96 z-40 p-5 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b0d19]/90 border border-white/[0.14] shadow-2xl backdrop-blur-xl transition-all duration-300 max-h-[85vh] overflow-y-auto\\\"\\n        >\\n          <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-white/[0.08]\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n              <Sliders className=\\\"w-4 h-4 text-cyan-400\\\" />\\n              <h2 className=\\\"text-sm font-semibold text-white\\\">Beam Dynamics Inspector</h2>\\n            </div>\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2\\\">\\n              <button\\n                onClick={handleReset}\\n                title=\\\"Reset to initial defaults\\\"\\n                className=\\\"p-1 rounded text-slate-400 hover:text-white hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\\\"\\n                aria-label=\\\"Reset settings\\\"\\n              >\\n                <RotateCcw className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5\\\" />\\n              </button>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setShowControls(false)}\\n                className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-white px-2 py-0.5 rounded hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\\\"\\n                aria-label=\\\"Close inspector\\\"\\n              >\\n                Close\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Color Scheme Presets */}\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-4\\\">\\n            <label className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-300 block mb-2\\\">\\n              Chromatic Beam Palette\\n            </label>\\n            <div className=\\\"grid grid-cols-1 gap-1.5\\\">\\n              {COLOR_PRESETS.map((preset) => {\\n                const isSelected = selectedPreset.id === preset.id;\\n                return (\\n                  <button\\n                    key={preset.id}\\n                    onClick={() => setSelectedPreset(preset)}\\n                    className={`flex items-center justify-between p-2 rounded-lg border text-left transition-all ${\\n                      isSelected\\n                        ? \'border-cyan-400/60 bg-white/[0.08]\'\\n                        : \'border-white/[0.06] bg-white/[0.02] hover:bg-white/[0.05]\'\\n                    }`}\\n                  >\\n                    <div className=\\\"flex items-center gap-2.5\\\">\\n                      {/* Dual-color swatch preview */}\\n                      <div className=\\\"w-6 h-6 rounded-md overflow-hidden border border-white/20 flex shrink-0\\\">\\n                        <div\\n                          className=\\\"w-1/2 h-full\\\"\\n                          style={{ backgroundColor: preset.core }}\\n                        />\\n                        <div\\n                          className=\\\"w-1/2 h-full\\\"\\n                          style={{ backgroundColor: preset.secondary }}\\n                        />\\n                      </div>\\n                      <div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-200\\\">\\n                          {preset.name}\\n                        </div>\\n                        <div className=\\\"text-[10px] text-slate-400 line-clamp-1\\\">\\n                          {preset.description}\\n                        </div>\\n                      </div>\\n                    </div>\\n                    {isSelected && (\\n                      <Check className=\\\"w-3.5 h-3.5 text-cyan-400 shrink-0\\\" />\\n                    )}\\n                  </button>\\n                );\\n              })}\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n\\n          {/* Sliders */}\\n          <div className=\\\"mt-5 space-y-4\\\">\\n            {/* Intensity */}\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1.5\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-slate-300\\\">Beam Intensity</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-cyan-400 tabular-nums\\\">\\n                  {Math.round(intensity * 100)}%\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"range\\\"\\n                min=\\\"0.3\\\"\\n                max=\\\"1.6\\\"\\n                step=\\\"0.05\\\"\\n                value={intensity}\\n                onChange={(e) => setIntensity(parseFloat(e.target.value))}\\n                className=\\\"w-full accent-cyan-400 cursor-pointer h-1.5 bg-white/10 rounded-lg appearance-none\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Cone Spread Angle */}\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1.5\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-slate-300\\\">Volumetric Cone Spread</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-cyan-400 tabular-nums\\\">\\n                  {spreadAngle}\302\260\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"range\\\"\\n                min=\\\"20\\\"\\n                max=\\\"65\\\"\\n                step=\\\"1\\\"\\n                value={spreadAngle}\\n                onChange={(e) => setSpreadAngle(parseInt(e.target.value, 10))}\\n                className=\\\"w-full accent-cyan-400 cursor-pointer h-1.5 bg-white/10 rounded-lg appearance-none\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Mouse Sway Parallax */}\\n            <div>\\n              <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between text-xs mb-1.5\\\">\\n                <span className=\\\"text-slate-300\\\">Cursor Sway Sensitivity</span>\\n                <span className=\\\"font-mono text-cyan-400 tabular-nums\\\">\\n                  \302\261{maxSway}\302\260\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <input\\n                type=\\\"range\\\"\\n                min=\\\"0\\\"\\n                max=\\\"16\\\"\\n                step=\\\"1\\\"\\n                value={maxSway}\\n                onChange={(e) => setMaxSway(parseInt(e.target.value, 10))}\\n                className=\\\"w-full accent-cyan-400 cursor-pointer h-1.5 bg-white/10 rounded-lg appearance-none\\\"\\n              />\\n            </div>\\n\\n            {/* Idle Breathing Motion Toggle */}\\n            <div className=\\\"pt-2 flex items-center justify-between\\\">\\n              <div>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-xs font-medium text-slate-200 block\\\">\\n                  Idle Breathing Motion\\n                </span>\\n                <span className=\\\"text-[11px] text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  Subtle organic wave and scale drift\\n                </span>\\n              </div>\\n              <button\\n                type=\\\"button\\\"\\n                role=\\\"switch\\\"\\n                aria-checked={idleMotion}\\n                onClick={() => setIdleMotion(!idleMotion)}\\n                className={`relative w-9 h-5 rounded-full p-0.5 transition-colors ${\\n                  idleMotion ? \'bg-cyan-500\' : \'bg-white/15\'\\n                }`}\\n              >\\n                <div\\n                  className={`w-4 h-4 rounded-full bg-white transition-transform ${\\n                    idleMotion ? \'translate-x-4\' : \'translate-x-0\'\\n                  }`}\\n                />\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </aside>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* \\n        ========================================================================\\n        5. DETAILS / ARCHITECTURE MODAL\\n        ========================================================================\\n      */}\\n      {showDetails && (\\n        <div className=\\\"fixed inset-0 z-50 flex items-center justify-center p-4 bg-black/60 backdrop-blur-sm\\\">\\n          <div className=\\\"relative w-full max-w-lg p-6 rounded-2xl bg-[#0b0d19] border border-white/20 shadow-2xl\\\">\\n            <div className=\\\"flex items-center justify-between pb-3 border-b border-white/10\\\">\\n              <h3 className=\\\"text-base font-semibold text-white\\\">\\n                Volumetric Light Architecture\\n              </h3>\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setShowDetails(false)}\\n                className=\\\"text-xs text-slate-400 hover:text-white px-2 py-1 rounded hover:bg-white/10\\\"\\n              >\\n                Close\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-4 space-y-3 text-xs text-slate-300 leading-relaxed\\\">\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08]\\\">\\n                <strong className=\\\"text-cyan-300 block mb-1\\\">\\n                  Negative Constraints Complied:\\n                </strong>\\n                No grid lines, coordinate crosses, star dots, or floating dust speckles.\\n                The velvet finish is mathematically generated using multi-layer feathered\\n                radial stops and screen blend modes.\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08]\\\">\\n                <strong className=\\\"text-cyan-300 block mb-1\\\">\\n                  Multi-Pass Optical Compositing:\\n                </strong>\\n                <ul className=\\\"list-disc list-inside space-y-1 text-slate-400\\\">\\n                  <li>Pass 1: Broad atmospheric fog bloom (blur: 64px)</li>\\n                  <li>Pass 2: Volumetric body cone (#00f2fe into #8a2be2)</li>\\n                  <li>Pass 3: Concentrated high-luminance core beam</li>\\n                  <li>Pass 4: Emitter fixture aperture bloom around toggle</li>\\n                  <li>Pass 5: Ground / wall bounce wash on bottom-left</li>\\n                </ul>\\n              </div>\\n\\n              <div className=\\\"p-3 rounded-lg bg-white/[0.03] border border-white/[0.08]\\\">\\n                <strong className=\\\"text-cyan-300 block mb-1\\\">\\n                  Mouse Reactivity & Fluidity:\\n                </strong>\\n                Cursor movement sways the beam angle by \302\261{maxSway}\302\260 using an exponential\\n                decay lerp (`0.06`), ensuring natural dampening and silky 60fps tracking.\\n              </div>\\n            </div>\\n\\n            <div className=\\\"mt-5 flex justify-end\\\">\\n              <button\\n                onClick={() => setShowDetails(false)}\\n                className=\\\"px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-semibold rounded-lg bg-white text-slate-900 hover:bg-slate-200 transition-colors\\\"\\n              >\\n                Got it\\n              </button>\\n            </div>\\n          </div>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n\\n      {/* Floating Zen Mode exit hint */}\\n      {pureCanvasView && (\\n        <div className=\\\"fixed bottom-6 left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 z-40 flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900/80 border border-white/10 backdrop-blur-md text-[11px] text-slate-400 animate-fade-in\\\">\\n          <span>Move cursor to sway beam \302\267 Click top-right switch to toggle light</span>\\n          <span aria-hidden=\\\"true\\\">\302\267</span>\\n          <button\\n            onClick={() => setPureCanvasView(false)}\\n            className=\\\"text-cyan-400 font-medium hover:underline\\\"\\n          >\\n            Show Controls\\n          </button>\\n        </div>\\n      )}\\n    </main>\\n  );\\n}\\n\",\"Description\":\"Implement complete interactive application with VolumetricLightBeam background and glassmorphic Illuminate toggle\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/App.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Writing App component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Implement interactive background application in App.tsx\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
    }
    thinking_duration {
