  user_input {
    user_response: "Please make the following targeted updates to the current code:\n\n1. Disable Cursor Tracking:\n   - Remove the mouse/cursor tracking listener completely so the light beam stays in a fixed, natural diagonal angle (top-right to bottom-left) without following the pointer.\n   - Keep only a subtle, slow idle breathing/undulating animation.\n   - Remove the bottom instruction bar (\"Move cursor to sway beam...\").\n\n2. Add Floating Stars/Dots (Dust Particles):\n   - Add scattered, faint twinkling star/dot particles across the canvas.\n   - Particles should slowly float upwards or drift ambiently.\n   - When particles pass inside the cyan/purple light beam, make them catch the light slightly (increase their brightness/opacity and give them a soft cyan glint).\n   - Ensure the particles look organic, subtle, and starry\342\200\224not aligned to any grid."
    items {
      text: "Please make the following targeted updates to the current code:\n\n1. Disable Cursor Tracking:\n   - Remove the mouse/cursor tracking listener completely so the light beam stays in a fixed, natural diagonal angle (top-right to bottom-left) without following the pointer.\n   - Keep only a subtle, slow idle breathing/undulating animation.\n   - Remove the bottom instruction bar (\"Move cursor to sway beam...\").\n\n2. Add Floating Stars/Dots (Dust Particles):\n   - Add scattered, faint twinkling star/dot particles across the canvas.\n   - Particles should slowly float upwards or drift ambiently.\n   - When particles pass inside the cyan/purple light beam, make them catch the light slightly (increase their brightness/opacity and give them a soft cyan glint).\n   - Ensure the particles look organic, subtle, and starry\342\200\224not aligned to any grid."
    }
  }
}
