    user_response: "Please update the background layout to match the centered lighting style of https://illuminate-toggle.webflow.io/:\n\n1. Center the Light Source:\n   - Move the light source from the top-right corner to the top-center of the viewport.\n   - Project a soft, wide conical spotlight directly downward across the center of the screen, fading gracefully toward the edges and bottom.\n   - Blend electric cyan (#00f2fe) in the center core into neon violet (#8a2be2) along the outer edges, tapering smoothly into the deep navy-black (#0b0d19) canvas.\n\n2. Reposition the Illuminate Toggle:\n   - Place the \"Illuminate\" toggle switch at the top center, sitting directly at the apex/source of the downward spotlight.\n\n3. Particle Adaptation:\n   - Keep the floating starry dust particles, increasing their brightness and glow as they drift through the central cone of light."
    items {
      text: "Please update the background layout to match the centered lighting style of https://illuminate-toggle.webflow.io/:\n\n1. Center the Light Source:\n   - Move the light source from the top-right corner to the top-center of the viewport.\n   - Project a soft, wide conical spotlight directly downward across the center of the screen, fading gracefully toward the edges and bottom.\n   - Blend electric cyan (#00f2fe) in the center core into neon violet (#8a2be2) along the outer edges, tapering smoothly into the deep navy-black (#0b0d19) canvas.\n\n2. Reposition the Illuminate Toggle:\n   - Place the \"Illuminate\" toggle switch at the top center, sitting directly at the apex/source of the downward spotlight.\n\n3. Particle Adaptation:\n   - Keep the floating starry dust particles, increasing their brightness and glow as they drift through the central cone of light."
