  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Adjusting Illumination\'s Source**\n\nI\'m working to adapt the background layout. The current focus is centering the light source. I\'m calculating the viewport\'s center using `width / 2` and `top`, aiming to mirror the centered lighting style seen on the example website. The goal is a visually appealing illumination shift!\n\n\n**Refining Light Placement**\n\nI\'m now integrating a soft, downward conical spotlight. It begins with electric cyan in its core, fading to neon violet, then blending into navy-black at the edges. I\'ve placed the \"Illuminate\" toggle directly at the light\'s apex, at the top center, matching toggle position. Finally, I\'m adjusting particle brightness to follow the light\'s core, and have ensured the math and layout is correct for the light\'s origin and direction.\n\n\n**Projecting a Downward Spotlight**\n\nI\'m implementing a wide, downward conical spotlight. The angle ranges from `angle - halfSpread` to `angle + halfSpread`, with an `angle` of `Math.PI / 2`. I\'m creating various passes: a broad bloom, a volumetric body with color blends, a core beam, an aperture glow, and a floor bounce. I\'m also now checking particle positions within the central cone.\n\n\n**Verifying Central Cone Inclusion**\n\nI\'m now making sure that I have particle positions, and checking whether they are within the central cone of the spotlight. I\'m using calculations involving `dx`, `dy`, and the angle `pAngle` to determine this. My goal is to catch the light effectively and apply the electric cyan core glow, increased brightness, and glint. I\'m also ensuring that the \"Illuminate\" toggle switch, located at the apex of the downward spotlight, is properly positioned in the layout. I am evaluating different layout options, to provide the best user experience.\n\n\n"
    tool_calls {
      id: "call_1661752"
      name: "write_to_file"
      arguments_json: "{\"CodeContent\":\"import React, { useEffect, useRef } from \'react\';\\n\\nexport interface VolumetricLightBeamProps {\\n  /** Mode: \'dark\' (default cosmic beam) or \'illuminated\' (boosted radiant beam) */\\n  isIlluminated?: boolean;\\n  /** Primary core color (e.g. electric cyan #00f2fe) */\\n  coreColor?: string;\\n  /** Secondary gradient color (e.g. neon violet/purple #8a2be2) */\\n  secondaryColor?: string;\\n  /** Base canvas solid background color (default #0b0d19) */\\n  backgroundColor?: string;\\n  /** Multiplier for overall beam brightness/opacity (default 1.0) */\\n  intensityMultiplier?: number;\\n  /** Beam cone spread in degrees (default ~56\302\260 for a generous centered cone) */\\n  spreadAngleDeg?: number;\\n  /** Whether idle breathing motion is active (default true) */\\n  idleMotion?: boolean;\\n  /** Whether floating star/dust particles are rendered (default true) */\\n  showParticles?: boolean;\\n  /** Optional custom origin coordinates {x, y} in pixels. If omitted, uses top-center anchor */\\n  originOverride?: { x: number; y: number } | null;\\n  /** Callback notifying parent of the calculated light origin {x, y} */\\n  onOriginUpdate?: (origin: { x: number; y: number }) => void;\\n  /** Custom class name for container */\\n  className?: string;\\n}\\n\\ninterface StarParticle {\\n  x: number;          // 0 to 1 normalized\\n  y: number;          // 0 to 1 normalized\\n  radius: number;     // pixel radius (subtle, 0.6 - 1.8px)\\n  speedY: number;     // slow upward drift\\n  speedX: number;     // gentle horizontal drift\\n  baseAlpha: number;  // 0.15 - 0.45\\n  twinkleFreq: number;// oscillation speed\\n  twinklePhase: number;\\n  driftPhase: number;\\n}\\n\\n/**\\n * VolumetricLightBeam\\n * \\n * Centered downward spotlight layout matching illuminate-toggle.webflow.io:\\n * - Light source centered at the top of the viewport directly behind the toggle switch.\\n * - Soft, wide conical spotlight projecting directly downward across the center.\\n * - Electric cyan (#00f2fe) in the center core blending into neon violet (#8a2be2) along outer edges.\\n * - Tapers smoothly into velvety deep navy-black (#0b0d19).\\n * - Floating starry dust particles catching soft cyan/violet glints as they enter the beam.\\n */\\nexport const VolumetricLightBeam: React.FC<VolumetricLightBeamProps> = ({\\n  isIlluminated = false,\\n  coreColor = \'#00f2fe\',\\n  secondaryColor = \'#8a2be2\',\\n  backgroundColor = \'#0b0d19\',\\n  intensityMultiplier = 1.0,\\n  spreadAngleDeg = 54,\\n  idleMotion = true,\\n  showParticles = true,\\n  originOverride = null,\\n  onOriginUpdate,\\n  className = \'\',\\n}) => {\\n  const canvasRef = useRef<HTMLCanvasElement | null>(null);\\n  const animFrameRef = useRef<number | null>(null);\\n\\n  // Dynamic state tracked for smooth breathing and physics\\n  const stateRef = useRef({\\n    currentIntensity: isIlluminated ? 1.45 : 1.0,\\n    targetIntensity: isIlluminated ? 1.45 : 1.0,\\n    currentSpread: (spreadAngleDeg * Math.PI) / 180,\\n    targetSpread: (spreadAngleDeg * Math.PI) / 180,\\n    originX: 0,\\n    originY: 0,\\n    startTime: performance.now(),\\n    particles: [] as StarParticle[],\\n  });\\n\\n  // Initialize scattered, organic floating star/dot particles\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const particleCount = 100;\\n    const particles: StarParticle[] = [];\\n    for (let i = 0; i < particleCount; i++) {\\n      particles.push({\\n        x: Math.random(),\\n        y: Math.random(),\\n        radius: 0.6 + Math.random() * 1.3,\\n        speedY: -(0.00014 + Math.random() * 0.00032), // gentle upward float\\n        speedX: (Math.random() - 0.5) * 0.00008,      // ambient drift\\n        baseAlpha: 0.14 + Math.random() * 0.32,\\n        twinkleFreq: 1.0 + Math.random() * 2.2,\\n        twinklePhase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\\n        driftPhase: Math.random() * Math.PI * 2,\\n      });\\n    }\\n    stateRef.current.particles = particles;\\n  }, []);\\n\\n  // Keep target spread & intensity updated when props change\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    stateRef.current.targetIntensity = (isIlluminated ? 1.45 : 1.0) * intensityMultiplier;\\n    stateRef.current.targetSpread = (spreadAngleDeg * Math.PI) / 180;\\n  }, [isIlluminated, intensityMultiplier, spreadAngleDeg]);\\n\\n  // Sync CSS custom properties on document element for smooth glassmorphism / ambient transitions\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const root = document.documentElement;\\n    root.style.setProperty(\'--beam-intensity\', String(isIlluminated ? 1.45 * intensityMultiplier : 1.0 * intensityMultiplier));\\n    root.style.setProperty(\'--beam-core-color\', coreColor);\\n    root.style.setProperty(\'--beam-secondary-color\', secondaryColor);\\n    root.style.setProperty(\'--bg-navy\', backgroundColor);\\n    root.style.setProperty(\'--illuminate-state\', isIlluminated ? \'illuminated\' : \'dark\');\\n  }, [isIlluminated, coreColor, secondaryColor, backgroundColor, intensityMultiplier]);\\n\\n  // Main high-performance render loop\\n  useEffect(() => {\\n    const canvas = canvasRef.current;\\n    if (!canvas) return;\\n\\n    const ctx = canvas.getContext(\'2d\', { alpha: false });\\n    if (!ctx) return;\\n\\n    let dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);\\n\\n    const resize = () => {\\n      dpr = Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio || 1, 2);\\n      const width = window.innerWidth;\\n      const height = window.innerHeight;\\n\\n      canvas.width = Math.floor(width * dpr);\\n      canvas.height = Math.floor(height * dpr);\\n      canvas.style.width = `${width}px`;\\n      canvas.style.height = `${height}px`;\\n\\n      // Origin point: Centered horizontally at the top, directly at the Illuminate switch\\n      const defaultOriginX = width / 2;\\n      const defaultOriginY = Math.max(48, height * 0.05);\\n\\n      const ox = originOverride ? originOverride.x : defaultOriginX;\\n      const oy = originOverride ? originOverride.y : defaultOriginY;\\n\\n      stateRef.current.originX = ox;\\n      stateRef.current.originY = oy;\\n\\n      if (onOriginUpdate) {\\n        onOriginUpdate({ x: ox, y: oy });\\n      }\\n    };\\n\\n    resize();\\n    window.addEventListener(\'resize\', resize, { passive: true });\\n\\n    // Render step\\n    const render = (now: number) => {\\n      const state = stateRef.current;\\n      const time = (now - state.startTime) * 0.001;\\n      const width = canvas.width / dpr;\\n      const height = canvas.height / dpr;\\n\\n      // 1. Fixed downward base angle pointing straight down (Math.PI / 2) across viewport center\\n      const baseAngle = Math.PI / 2;\\n\\n      // 2. Subtle, slow idle breathing/undulating animation\\n      const idleAngleDrift = idleMotion ? Math.sin(time * 0.45) * 0.012 : 0;\\n      const idleBreathingIntensity = idleMotion ? Math.sin(time * 0.8) * 0.06 : 0;\\n      const idleSpreadDrift = idleMotion ? Math.cos(time * 0.6) * 0.025 : 0;\\n\\n      const angle = baseAngle + idleAngleDrift;\\n\\n      // Smooth dampening for intensity & spread adjustments\\n      state.currentIntensity += (state.targetIntensity - state.currentIntensity) * 0.08;\\n      state.currentSpread += (state.targetSpread - state.currentSpread) * 0.06;\\n\\n      const intensity = Math.max(0.05, state.currentIntensity * (1 + idleBreathingIntensity));\\n      const spread = Math.max(0.1, state.currentSpread + idleSpreadDrift);\\n      const halfSpread = spread / 2;\\n\\n      // Setup drawing transform for HiDPI\\n      ctx.save();\\n      ctx.scale(dpr, dpr);\\n\\n      // 3. Solid velvety base background (deep midnight navy #0b0d19)\\n      if (isIlluminated) {\\n        ctx.fillStyle = \'#0e1124\';\\n      } else {\\n        ctx.fillStyle = backgroundColor;\\n      }\\n      ctx.fillRect(0, 0, width, height);\\n\\n      const ox = state.originX;\\n      const oy = state.originY;\\n      const reach = Math.max(height * 1.35, Math.hypot(width / 2, height) * 1.15);\\n\\n      // Helper to draw a downward conical polygon\\n      const drawConePath = (coneHalfAngle: number) => {\\n        ctx.beginPath();\\n        ctx.moveTo(ox, oy);\\n        const steps = 24;\\n        const startA = angle - coneHalfAngle;\\n        const endA = angle + coneHalfAngle;\\n        for (let i = 0; i <= steps; i++) {\\n          const a = startA + (endA - startA) * (i / steps);\\n          const px = ox + Math.cos(a) * reach;\\n          const py = oy + Math.sin(a) * reach;\\n          ctx.lineTo(px, py);\\n        }\\n        ctx.closePath();\\n      };\\n\\n      // PASS 1: Broad Velvety Ambient Fog / Bloom (Heavy Blur, soft atmospheric falloff)\\n      ctx.save();\\n      ctx.globalCompositeOperation = \'screen\';\\n      if (\'filter\' in ctx) {\\n        ctx.filter = \'blur(68px)\';\\n      }\\n      drawConePath(halfSpread * 1.6);\\n      const gradAmbient = ctx.createRadialGradient(ox, oy, 15, ox, oy, reach * 0.95);\\n      gradAmbient.addColorStop(0.0, hexToRgba(coreColor, 0.35 * intensity));\\n      gradAmbient.addColorStop(0.35, hexToRgba(secondaryColor, 0.24 * intensity));\\n      gradAmbient.addColorStop(0.70, hexToRgba(secondaryColor, 0.08 * intensity));\\n      gradAmbient.addColorStop(1.0, \'rgba(11, 13, 25, 0)\');\\n      ctx.fillStyle = gradAmbient;\\n      ctx.fill();\\n      ctx.restore();\\n\\n      // PASS 2: Main Volumetric Spotlight Body (Medium Blur, Electric Cyan in center into Neon Violet along edges)\\n      ctx.save();\\n      ctx.globalCompositeOperation = \'screen\';\\n      if (\'filter\' in ctx) {\\n        ctx.filter = \'blur(32px)\';\\n      }\\n      drawConePath(halfSpread);\\n      const gradMain = ctx.createRadialGradient(ox, oy, 10, ox, oy, reach * 0.88);\\n      gradMain.addColorStop(0.00, hexToRgba(coreColor, 0.90 * intensity));\\n      gradMain.addColorStop(0.12, hexToRgba(coreColor, 0.75 * intensity));\\n      gradMain.addColorStop(0.32, hexToRgba(\'#4f46e5\', 0.60 * intensity));\\n      gradMain.addColorStop(0.55, hexToRgba(secondaryColor, 0.45 * intensity)); // Neon violet along edges & depth\\n      gradMain.addColorStop(0.80, hexToRgba(secondaryColor, 0.15 * intensity));\\n      gradMain.addColorStop(1.00, \'rgba(11, 13, 25, 0)\');\\n      ctx.fillStyle = gradMain;\\n      ctx.fill();\\n      ctx.restore();\\n\\n      // PASS 3: Core Intense Concentrated Beam (Luminous highlight down the central axis)\\n      ctx.save();\\n      ctx.globalCompositeOperation = \'screen\';\\n      if (\'filter\' in ctx) {\\n        ctx.filter = \'blur(16px)\';\\n      }\\n      drawConePath(halfSpread * 0.45);\\n      const gradCore = ctx.createRadialGradient(ox, oy, 0, ox, oy, reach * 0.70);\\n      gradCore.addColorStop(0.00, hexToRgba(\'#ffffff\', 0.98 * intensity));\\n      gradCore.addColorStop(0.08, hexToRgba(coreColor, 0.88 * intensity));\\n      gradCore.addColorStop(0.32, hexToRgba(coreColor, 0.50 * intensity));\\n      gradCore.addColorStop(0.65, hexToRgba(secondaryColor, 0.22 * intensity));\\n      gradCore.addColorStop(1.00, \'rgba(11, 13, 25, 0)\');\\n      ctx.fillStyle = gradCore;\\n      ctx.fill();\\n      ctx.restore();\\n\\n      // PASS 4: Stage Light Apex / Emitter Fixture Glow (Centered directly around top toggle switch)\\n      ctx.save();\\n      ctx.globalCompositeOperation = \'screen\';\\n      if (\'filter\' in ctx) {\\n        ctx.filter = \'blur(22px)\';\\n      }\\n      const apexGlowRadius = Math.min(260, width * 0.35);\\n      const apertureGlow = ctx.createRadialGradient(ox, oy, 0, ox, oy, apexGlowRadius);\\n      apertureGlow.addColorStop(0.00, hexToRgba(\'#ffffff\', 0.98 * intensity));\\n      apertureGlow.addColorStop(0.15, hexToRgba(coreColor, 0.78 * intensity));\\n      apertureGlow.addColorStop(0.48, hexToRgba(secondaryColor, 0.38 * intensity));\\n      apertureGlow.addColorStop(1.00, \'rgba(11, 13, 25, 0)\');\\n      ctx.fillStyle = apertureGlow;\\n      ctx.beginPath();\\n      ctx.arc(ox, oy, apexGlowRadius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n      ctx.fill();\\n      ctx.restore();\\n\\n      // PASS 5: Floor Stage Wash / Ground Bloom (Centered at bottom of the screen where beam lands)\\n      ctx.save();\\n      ctx.globalCompositeOperation = \'screen\';\\n      if (\'filter\' in ctx) {\\n        ctx.filter = \'blur(85px)\';\\n      }\\n      const floorX = width / 2;\\n      const floorY = height * 0.95;\\n      const floorRadius = Math.min(520, width * 0.65);\\n      const floorGrad = ctx.createRadialGradient(floorX, floorY, 0, floorX, floorY, floorRadius);\\n      floorGrad.addColorStop(0.00, hexToRgba(secondaryColor, 0.26 * intensity));\\n      floorGrad.addColorStop(0.38, hexToRgba(coreColor, 0.12 * intensity));\\n      floorGrad.addColorStop(1.00, \'rgba(11, 13, 25, 0)\');\\n      ctx.fillStyle = floorGrad;\\n      ctx.beginPath();\\n      // Draw an elongated stage pool ellipse\\n      ctx.ellipse(floorX, floorY, floorRadius, floorRadius * 0.45, 0, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n      ctx.fill();\\n      ctx.restore();\\n\\n      // PASS 6: Floating Star / Dust Particles\\n      // - Scattered, faint twinkling stars drifting slowly upward\\n      // - Brightening and catching soft cyan/violet glints as they pass through the central cone\\n      if (showParticles && state.particles.length > 0) {\\n        const particles = state.particles;\\n        const beamConeHalfAngle = halfSpread * 1.15;\\n\\n        for (let i = 0; i < particles.length; i++) {\\n          const p = particles[i];\\n\\n          // Slow upward float and gentle ambient wave\\n          p.y += p.speedY;\\n          p.x += p.speedX + Math.sin(time * 0.45 + p.driftPhase) * 0.0001;\\n\\n          // Wrap boundaries organically\\n          if (p.y < -0.02) {\\n            p.y = 1.02;\\n            p.x = Math.random();\\n          }\\n          if (p.x < -0.02) p.x = 1.02;\\n          if (p.x > 1.02) p.x = -0.02;\\n\\n          const px = p.x * width;\\n          const py = p.y * height;\\n\\n          // Calculate angle and distance from top-center light origin\\n          const dx = px - ox;\\n          const dy = py - oy;\\n          const dist = Math.hypot(dx, dy);\\n          const pAngle = Math.atan2(dy, dx);\\n\\n          // Angular difference relative to downward beam direction (Math.PI / 2)\\n          let diff = pAngle - angle;\\n          while (diff > Math.PI) diff -= Math.PI * 2;\\n          while (diff < -Math.PI) diff += Math.PI * 2;\\n          const absDiff = Math.abs(diff);\\n\\n          // Determine if particle is inside the central conical light beam\\n          let inBeam = 0;\\n          if (absDiff < beamConeHalfAngle && dist < reach * 0.95 && py >= oy) {\\n            const lateral = 1 - absDiff / beamConeHalfAngle;\\n            const longitudinal = Math.max(0, 1 - dist / (reach * 0.95));\\n            inBeam = Math.pow(lateral, 1.25) * (0.35 + 0.65 * longitudinal);\\n          }\\n\\n          // Twinkle oscillation\\n          const twinkle = 0.72 + 0.28 * Math.sin(time * p.twinkleFreq + p.twinklePhase);\\n\\n          if (inBeam > 0.05) {\\n            // Particle catches the light inside the central beam\\n            const beamBoost = inBeam * 0.75 * intensity;\\n            const alpha = Math.min(1.0, (p.baseAlpha + beamBoost) * twinkle);\\n            const renderedRadius = p.radius * (1 + inBeam * 0.4);\\n\\n            // Soft cyan glint aura\\n            ctx.save();\\n            ctx.globalCompositeOperation = \'screen\';\\n            ctx.fillStyle = hexToRgba(coreColor, inBeam * 0.35 * intensity);\\n            ctx.beginPath();\\n            ctx.arc(px, py, renderedRadius * 2.8, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n            ctx.fill();\\n\\n            // Bright sparkling core catching light\\n            ctx.fillStyle = inBeam > 0.38 ? hexToRgba(\'#e4fcff\', alpha) : hexToRgba(coreColor, alpha);\\n            ctx.beginPath();\\n            ctx.arc(px, py, renderedRadius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n            ctx.fill();\\n            ctx.restore();\\n          } else {\\n            // Faint ambient star twinkling outside the beam\\n            const alpha = p.baseAlpha * twinkle;\\n            ctx.save();\\n            ctx.fillStyle = `rgba(215, 230, 255, ${alpha.toFixed(3)})`;\\n            ctx.beginPath();\\n            ctx.arc(px, py, p.radius, 0, Math.PI * 2);\\n            ctx.fill();\\n            ctx.restore();\\n          }\\n        }\\n      }\\n\\n      ctx.restore();\\n\\n      animFrameRef.current = requestAnimationFrame(render);\\n    };\\n\\n    animFrameRef.current = requestAnimationFrame(render);\\n\\n    return () => {\\n      window.removeEventListener(\'resize\', resize);\\n      if (animFrameRef.current) {\\n        cancelAnimationFrame(animFrameRef.current);\\n      }\\n    };\\n  }, [coreColor, secondaryColor, backgroundColor, idleMotion, showParticles, originOverride, onOriginUpdate, isIlluminated]);\\n\\n  return (\\n    <div className={`fixed inset-0 pointer-events-none select-none overflow-hidden ${className}`}>\\n      <canvas\\n        ref={canvasRef}\\n        className=\\\"absolute inset-0 block w-full h-full\\\"\\n        style={{\\n          backgroundColor,\\n          mixBlendMode: \'normal\',\\n        }}\\n      />\\n    </div>\\n  );\\n};\\n\\n/**\\n * Utility helper to convert hex to rgba string\\n */\\nfunction hexToRgba(hex: string, alpha: number): string {\\n  let c = hex.trim();\\n  if (c.startsWith(\'#\')) {\\n    c = c.slice(1);\\n  }\\n  if (c.length === 3) {\\n    c = c.split(\'\').map((char) => char + char).join(\'\');\\n  }\\n  const num = parseInt(c, 16);\\n  if (isNaN(num)) {\\n    return `rgba(0, 242, 254, ${alpha})`;\\n  }\\n  const r = (num >> 16) & 255;\\n  const g = (num >> 8) & 255;\\n  const b = num & 255;\\n  return `rgba(${r}, ${g}, ${b}, ${Math.max(0, Math.min(1, alpha))})`;\\n}\\n\\nexport default VolumetricLightBeam;\\n\",\"Description\":\"Update VolumetricLightBeam to centered downward spotlight layout matching illuminate-toggle.webflow.io\",\"Overwrite\":true,\"TargetFile\":\"/src/components/VolumetricLightBeam.tsx\",\"toolAction\":\"Updating component\",\"toolSummary\":\"Update VolumetricLightBeam to centered downward spotlight\"}"
      thought_signature: ""
      original_name: "write_to_file"
